        <h1 class="post-detail__title">Community Counts: Teton Rock Gym</h1>

        <div class="post-detail__featured-image">
          <img src="/assets/images/news/50094.webp" alt="Community Counts: Teton Rock Gym" loading="lazy">
        </div>

        <div class="post-detail__content">
          <p><a href="https://tetonrockgym.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Teton Rock Gym</a> is more than just a climbing gym. It’s a special place where community members and newcomers can have a home base, a place to meet up, rain or shine, to make new friends, and spend time with family. Teton Rock Gym is a place where people build the kinds of relationships that make a place a home.<br><br>For the children that come here, it’s a place where they are comfortable being themselves and feel safe to try new things. Through our climbing programs, they learn to overcome physical and mental challenges and how to take care of their bodies in the process.<br><br>Our adult climbers and members have access to a multitude of climbing education classes, from beginner technique and top-rope belay classes to advanced multi-pitching, trad-climbing, and anchor-building courses. With the introduction of our 24 Hour Access memberships, we were able to weather the challenges of COVID-19, and expand our membership base to 200 climbers!<br><br>In addition to indoor rock climbing, we run an outdoor summer camp, host the Reel Rock Film Tour, offer aerial silks classes, climbing competitions, and adaptive climbing events.</p>

